# HakiOS defconfig for the Xiaomi Mi A2 (jasmine_sprout, SDM660): the common kernel's configuration, the SDM660 family's facts
# and this phone's own, put together the way Android puts a device's kernel configuration together.
#
# What is left out of the kernel is what is not this phone's: the reference phone's drivers (the Goodix touch screen on SPI,
# the UFS storage, the WCN6750's Wi-Fi) are the reference phone's hardware and must not touch this one. The drivers of this
# phone that are written yet are named in the note at the top of configs/jasmine_sprout.config.
#
# Needs the phone's own firmware pulled from your phone (pull-firmware.sh): `tools/hakios-config.py needs`.
#include common_defconfig
#include sdm660.config
#include jasmine_sprout.config
